  "review_notes": [
    "All4882raw bytes and6472organized bytes read separately; all12complete source commands and attached comments were inspected.",
    "Only the complete raw TraceTarget data record is materialized. The operation has no equations. Its label and future-specialization comment do not construct any analytic or geometric trace.",
    "The other records mix actual typed functions and value equalities with named unlinked propositions. All eleven remaining complete commands remain archived, including four genuine property projections and three genuine equality projections.",
    "The actual trace_formula fields are equations, not arbitrary Prop labels; their exact premises and both differently named K-side equation theorems remain distinct in the archive.",
    "A standalone theorem of those equations would require its same-file mixed formula record and trace types. No fields are dropped, no substitute type is created and no historical self-provider import is invented.",
    "The2999B SpectralKTheoryBridge and exact Witt/K contexts were read. The spectral bridge contains an actual sameClass value equality plus independent named propositions; the Witt image contains an actual image=realize(indexClass) equality. These facts do not establish a Chern/trace/analytic interpretation.",
    "An exact selected same-path Spectral.CategoricalSpectrum provider was not established; it remains unresolved. No infinite spectral sum, regularization, group law, true additivity, Atiyah-Singer or crystalline trace theorem is claimed."
  ],
